# The client pulls and catches the Alraune: the plant is gone for both and the creature is gone for both.
# Open (2026-11-03): now and then the host keeps shrieking after the client's catch. Each shriek is a one-shot
# ABI_Alraune_Scream projectile, so something on the host still fires them. Check with `A sfxfollow Alraune`.
# Hero 5 slot 0. Spot PickUp_Alraune at (6223,-477), Scene_Creatures.

include session.coop

# The swamp downs a fresh hero in seconds; two down is a lost run.
A run invincibility
B run invincibility
A tp 6180,-477
B tp 6160,-460
sleep 6
A expect interactables Alraune contains Interact_Alraune timeout=15
B expect interactables Alraune contains Interact_Alraune timeout=15

B expect use Interact_Alraune 300 contains used timeout=15
B expect ai Alraune contains dead=0 timeout=15
A expect ai Alraune contains dead=0 timeout=15

B expect talk Alraune DT_Main_Alraune contains talking timeout=20
B skip first
B expect dialogue contains "in=0" timeout=60
B expect actors 2000 !contains Alraune timeout=15
A expect actors 2000 !contains Alraune timeout=20
